---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Disclaimer" description={`${SITE.name}'s calculators are educational tools, not financial advice. Read how to use our results.`} updated="October 2026">
  <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on {SITE.domain}, including calculators, guides and examples, is for educational and informational
    purposes only. It is not financial, tax, legal or investment advice, and it is not a recommendation to take out,
    repay or switch any product.
  </p>

  <h2>Results are estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Results depend entirely on the figures you enter and on simplifying assumptions explained on each page. Real
    products can include fees, different compounding or payment dates, insurance or other terms that change the
    numbers. Your lender's or tax authority's figures always take precedence.
  </p>

  <h2>Tax and legal figures</h2>
  <p>
    Pages that use tax rates, allowances or legal limits state the tax year they apply to. We check these figures
    against official government sources, but rules change. Confirm current figures with the official source before
    making a decision.
  </p>

  <h2>Get professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    For decisions about your own situation, speak to a qualified, regulated financial adviser or a free, impartial
    money guidance service in your country.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is funded by advertising. Ads are provided by third parties and are not endorsements. We do not
    currently use affiliate links. If we add them, each one will be labelled on the page, and this section will list
    the companies we have affiliate relationships with. Affiliate relationships never change a calculator's results.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
